  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the World Bank for implementing technology pilots and enacting Right to Information legislation in Punjab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the World Bank for implementing technology pilots and enacting Right to Information legislation in Punjab is a component of Sub National Governance (SNG) - Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and Punjab reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,318,000. It works in the following sector(s): Media and free flow of information, Decentralisation and support to subnational government, Technological research and development.</narrative>
  </description>
